WEBVTT

00:00:18.644 --> 00:00:22.315
Admiral Sadri agrees to the truce!

00:00:22.565 --> 00:00:23.983
Thank you!

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:25.902
It was nothing!

00:00:29.113 --> 00:00:33.534
Your piloting skills are praiseworthy.

00:00:33.784 --> 00:00:35.411
But do not forget.

00:00:35.661 --> 00:00:39.540
As long as hatred smolders
within people's hearts...

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:43.961
...peace is nothing but a fleeting dream.

00:00:53.221 --> 00:00:59.810
<i>Soko ni nani ga aru toshite mo</i>

00:01:00.061 --> 00:01:08.486
<i>Mikai no ryouiki e kimi to</i>

00:01:16.744 --> 00:01:24.794
<i>Mijikai yume wo miteta ima</i>

00:01:25.044 --> 00:01:29.423
<i>Are wa kimi no senaka</i>

00:01:29.674 --> 00:01:35.596
<i>Kako? Mirai?</i>

00:01:35.846 --> 00:01:46.357
<i>Furikitte iru meetaa no hari wo mushi shite</i>

00:01:46.607 --> 00:01:49.485
<i>Oikaze to kanjou no muku hou e</i>

00:01:49.735 --> 00:01:55.658
<i>Habataku tabi kizukasareru</i>

00:01:55.908 --> 00:02:01.205
<i>Nido to deaenai sora ga aru koto</i>

00:02:01.455 --> 00:02:06.711
<i>Sore demo tobitatsu nara</i>

00:02:06.961 --> 00:02:13.509
<i>Kimi no tsubasa ni naru watashi ga</i>

00:02:35.197 --> 00:02:37.575
Thank you for tending to
things during my absence.

00:02:37.825 --> 00:02:42.705
My apologies for accepting
peace without your consent.

00:02:42.955 --> 00:02:45.458
You made the proper decision.

00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:49.962
The tactics you employed during the
Boreas battle were admirable as well.

00:02:50.212 --> 00:02:52.673
You are too kind.

00:03:21.285 --> 00:03:24.705
Luscinia! I am glad that you've returned!

00:03:25.748 --> 00:03:27.917
Gloria, Augusta.

00:03:28.167 --> 00:03:29.960
I am at your mercy.

00:03:34.006 --> 00:03:37.551
Much blood was shed in the recent fighting,

00:03:37.802 --> 00:03:40.513
for which I bear full responsibility.

00:03:40.763 --> 00:03:42.139
I offer my sincerest apologies

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:45.476
to Ades' subjects and all
the citizens of foreign lands.

00:03:47.853 --> 00:03:50.856
Vasant. Luscinia.

00:03:51.107 --> 00:03:56.570
I am truly happy that you've
gathered before me once more.

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:00.699
Please, you're too kind, Augusta.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:05.663
I am overwhelmed with the shame
of having pained Your Majesty.

00:04:05.913 --> 00:04:08.666
However, I had no choice but to take up arms

00:04:08.916 --> 00:04:13.212
in opposition to Premier Luscinia
and his heinous actions.

00:04:13.462 --> 00:04:17.007
Before peace is made, I demand
that the premier be replaced!

00:04:17.258 --> 00:04:18.551
You have it backwards!

00:04:18.801 --> 00:04:23.097
I motion that you be court-martialed
for your acts of treason!

00:04:23.347 --> 00:04:28.269
You fired upon the Augusta's flag!
Is that not treason?!

00:04:28.519 --> 00:04:31.897
We simply attempted to rescue
Her Majesty from disloyal hands!

00:04:32.148 --> 00:04:33.023
Disloyal?!

00:04:33.274 --> 00:04:34.108
Vasant.

00:04:34.358 --> 00:04:37.027
You turned your back on
the Ades Federation's cause

00:04:37.278 --> 00:04:39.280
and instead worked to benefit the repatriates!

00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:40.781
Cause?

00:04:41.031 --> 00:04:45.327
Destruction and invasion are
the Federation's only "cause" now,

00:04:45.578 --> 00:04:51.959
something the people of Turan, Glacies,
and Anatoray know all too well!

00:04:52.209 --> 00:04:54.086
Its cause is...

00:04:54.336 --> 00:04:58.090
The Federation's cause is to pass
this world's limited resources

00:04:58.340 --> 00:05:00.926
on to the next generation.

00:05:02.928 --> 00:05:05.764
The ruler of Turan understands this.

00:05:08.767 --> 00:05:12.271
The kingdom of Turan supports
the Federation's cause

00:05:12.521 --> 00:05:15.149
as Premier Luscinia has presented it.

00:05:16.609 --> 00:05:18.152
Witch!

00:05:23.574 --> 00:05:27.495
I, Millia il Velch Cutrettola Turan, ask to speak!

00:05:33.542 --> 00:05:37.213
L-I'm sorry! I'll bring another right away!

00:05:45.054 --> 00:05:46.764
How is security at the ball?

00:05:47.014 --> 00:05:48.182
Tighter than expected.

00:05:48.432 --> 00:05:50.351
I see...

00:05:52.019 --> 00:05:54.980
Sister, you are unfit to rule Turan!

00:05:55.231 --> 00:05:57.149
--Your duty is to the citizens of Turan!
--That's Princess Millia.

00:05:57.149 --> 00:06:00.444
--Your duty is to the citizens of Turan!
--I'm certain she will sympathize with our cause.

00:06:00.694 --> 00:06:03.113
Do whatever it takes to bring her.

00:06:03.364 --> 00:06:04.490
Princess Millia...

00:06:04.740 --> 00:06:07.785
You don't understand at all, Millia.

00:06:08.035 --> 00:06:12.289
Being an inhabitant of this world is
more important than being a Turan.

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:17.127
Is that why you used an Exile
to wipe out entire nations?!

00:06:17.378 --> 00:06:19.505
This world is too small.

00:06:19.755 --> 00:06:23.467
Far too small to provide
happiness to everyone on it.

00:06:23.717 --> 00:06:29.682
So that gives you the right to take
happiness from so many people?!

00:06:29.932 --> 00:06:30.849
In other words,

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:36.146
Princess Liliana willingly chose to
be one of Premier Luscinia's minions,

00:06:36.397 --> 00:06:41.193
and, as such, she's ill fit to
claim leadership of Turan...

00:06:41.443 --> 00:06:44.196
Is that what you're getting at, Princess Millia?

00:06:44.446 --> 00:06:46.448
Y-Yes...

00:06:46.699 --> 00:06:50.327
In any case, you have strayed
from the citizens' will!

00:06:50.578 --> 00:06:52.746
Please, wake up!

00:06:54.873 --> 00:06:58.877
It appears your plea has fallen on deaf ears.

00:06:59.128 --> 00:07:01.422
We will only accept the truce

00:07:01.672 --> 00:07:04.592
on the condition that
Premier Luscinia be replaced

00:07:04.842 --> 00:07:07.928
and that Lady Liliana be placed in our custody!

00:07:09.054 --> 00:07:12.349
After the tragedies that took
place in Turan and Glacies,

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:15.686
it's clear the Exile must be sealed away!

00:07:15.936 --> 00:07:16.979
What does she mean?

00:07:17.229 --> 00:07:19.398
She's saying Princess Liliana
needs to be locked up somewhere

00:07:19.648 --> 00:07:22.026
to keep the Exile from being used again.

00:07:22.276 --> 00:07:23.360
You can't be serious!

00:07:23.611 --> 00:07:26.447
Without the Exiles, this world
will never know peace.

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:30.117
People are greedy and thirst for blood.

00:07:30.367 --> 00:07:35.247
Left unchecked, their greed will
completely devour this world.

00:07:35.497 --> 00:07:37.124
Just as happened with the people of old.

00:07:37.374 --> 00:07:39.501
There's no room for compromise, then?

00:07:39.752 --> 00:07:41.837
Surely you realized that from the start.

00:07:42.087 --> 00:07:43.797
Stop this!

00:07:45.883 --> 00:07:47.551
Stop this...

00:07:47.801 --> 00:07:51.263
I won't allow any more fighting!

00:07:51.513 --> 00:07:54.975
Please, I ask that you
remember my mother's ideals...

00:07:55.225 --> 00:07:58.020
Vasant, stop condemning Luscinia!

00:07:58.270 --> 00:08:03.067
Luscinia, promise you'll
never use the Exile again!

00:08:07.946 --> 00:08:11.450
Sire-Us right! We all gotta get along!

00:08:11.700 --> 00:08:13.911
"Gloria, Augusta!" and all that!

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:21.043
Our soldiers are exhausted from battle.

00:08:21.293 --> 00:08:25.297
We should all rise above our
differences for the sake of peace.

00:08:50.864 --> 00:08:55.369
In the name of the Augusta,
I hereby declare the fighting over!

00:08:59.665 --> 00:09:01.083
Cheers!

00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:04.336
Looks like it's gonna end without a fight!

00:09:04.586 --> 00:09:06.463
Here's to peace!

00:09:06.714 --> 00:09:10.092
Hard to believe Pam's remark led to this!

00:09:10.342 --> 00:09:13.721
A ball, huh? I wish I could've gone too!

00:09:13.971 --> 00:09:16.223
You don't even dance!

00:09:26.984 --> 00:09:30.028
I can't tell if we're enemies or if we're friends...

00:09:30.279 --> 00:09:32.740
Indeed, it's happening so very fast.

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:35.951
Fighting cuts the ties between people.

00:09:36.201 --> 00:09:38.328
Even ties between friends...

00:09:38.579 --> 00:09:40.205
...and family.

00:09:46.712 --> 00:09:48.922
<i>So she is Rah-ax“?</i>

00:09:49.173 --> 00:09:51.300
Why do I have to dress up too?

00:09:51.550 --> 00:09:54.428
This ball is being held by the Augusta herself.

00:09:54.678 --> 00:09:56.472
But you look nice, surprisingly enough!

00:09:56.722 --> 00:09:58.474
What's that supposed to mean?

00:10:00.225 --> 00:10:01.852
Millia!

00:10:02.102 --> 00:10:03.270
Cheer up!

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:08.400
We finally have peace, and now you
can make up with Princess Liliana!

00:10:10.944 --> 00:10:13.280
I'm sure she'll understand if
you guys talk things through!

00:10:15.741 --> 00:10:17.409
--But...!
--Fam.

00:10:17.659 --> 00:10:19.119
<i>Okay -</i>

00:10:19.369 --> 00:10:21.205
Lady Fam Fan Fan.

00:10:22.372 --> 00:10:25.501
As the greatest contributor
to our newfound peace...

00:10:25.751 --> 00:10:28.837
...would you honor me with a dance?

00:10:29.087 --> 00:10:31.048
H-Huh?!

00:10:33.383 --> 00:10:34.551
What do you think?

00:10:34.802 --> 00:10:36.470
You look quite nice!

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.472
I mean about this peace.

00:10:38.722 --> 00:10:40.140
Hmm...

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:43.185
It's a pretty volatile situation, I'd say.

00:10:43.435 --> 00:10:46.188
All these menacing people
everywhere you look...

00:10:46.438 --> 00:10:49.483
Huh? Is that who I think it is?

00:10:55.072 --> 00:10:57.282
Are your parents well?

00:10:57.533 --> 00:10:58.909
Sorry!

00:10:59.159 --> 00:11:01.787
U-Uhh, what did you just ask?

00:11:02.037 --> 00:11:04.164
Where are your mother and father?

00:11:04.414 --> 00:11:07.835
I dunno. I've never seen them.

00:11:08.085 --> 00:11:10.170
Forgive my rudeness.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:14.716
Don't worry about it. People like
Atamora and Giselle are there for me.

00:11:14.967 --> 00:11:17.094
Have you always been a Sky Pirate?

00:11:17.344 --> 00:11:21.056
Yeah. I've been flying
ever since I can remember.

00:11:21.306 --> 00:11:23.308
--Were your parents as well?
--I'm not sure.

00:11:23.559 --> 00:11:27.646
I heard they were from another country
and that they died in an accident.

00:11:29.106 --> 00:11:30.607
The truth is...

00:11:32.359 --> 00:11:34.653
I'm so sorry!

00:11:41.869 --> 00:11:45.455
Well water from the Ruins of White.
Excellent quality.

00:11:45.706 --> 00:11:47.749
Let us drink to our new peace.

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.459
Thank you.

00:11:52.921 --> 00:11:57.009
I hear you were friends with General Sorfish.

00:11:58.135 --> 00:12:01.346
Having to fight a faithful friend is truly painful.

00:12:02.598 --> 00:12:06.226
I sympathize with how you feel, Princess.

00:12:10.105 --> 00:12:12.941
How did things come to this?

00:12:13.191 --> 00:12:17.654
Perhaps we're being tested for something.

00:12:19.239 --> 00:12:23.452
To tell if we're worthy for something...

00:12:28.040 --> 00:12:29.958
I'm glad we were able to talk.

00:12:39.092 --> 00:12:40.636
Princess Millia.

00:12:43.388 --> 00:12:44.973
My name is Emma.

00:12:47.976 --> 00:12:49.978
I've come on behalf of Major Geeth.

00:12:50.228 --> 00:12:51.813
The major?

00:12:53.565 --> 00:12:57.027
He wishes to speak with you
about Princess Liliana.

00:12:58.111 --> 00:12:59.655
About my sister?

00:13:02.616 --> 00:13:04.868
I am so sick of dancing now!

00:13:05.118 --> 00:13:07.913
I thought you did okay, though!

00:13:08.163 --> 00:13:09.915
Where's Millia?

00:13:22.177 --> 00:13:23.637
Well? Did you find her?!

00:13:23.887 --> 00:13:24.805
No.

00:13:25.055 --> 00:13:27.933
Dad and the others are looking for her now.

00:13:28.183 --> 00:13:31.228
Where did you run off to, Millia?

00:13:31.478 --> 00:13:34.022
Thank you for coming all
this way, Princess Millia.

00:13:34.272 --> 00:13:36.775
You wished to talk about my sister?

00:13:38.485 --> 00:13:42.030
We would like you to take the Turan throne.

00:13:42.280 --> 00:13:43.407
Me?

00:13:43.657 --> 00:13:46.410
All the people of Turan feel this way.

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.078
What does my sister say?

00:13:48.328 --> 00:13:51.039
Discussing it with her would be pointless.

00:13:51.289 --> 00:13:53.375
She's before me in the order of succession.

00:13:53.625 --> 00:13:57.045
To disregard that and crown
myself queen is out of the question!

00:13:57.295 --> 00:14:00.424
Then simply make yourself the first in line.

00:14:01.717 --> 00:14:05.220
I'm sure you're well aware
that she's been branded a witch.

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:07.180
Not only did she betray our homeland,

00:14:07.431 --> 00:14:09.891
she also controls the Exile for Luscinia

00:14:10.142 --> 00:14:12.894
in an attempt to make this world Ades'.

00:14:13.145 --> 00:14:15.313
We ask that you fulfill your royal duty.

00:14:15.564 --> 00:14:18.483
For the countless citizens who lost their lives.

00:14:20.652 --> 00:14:24.156
We will protect you with our lives.

00:14:24.406 --> 00:14:28.827
You must rebuild Turan and retake
our land from Ades' clutches!

00:14:29.077 --> 00:14:30.912
You are our only hope, Princess!

00:14:31.163 --> 00:14:32.956
Unless we do something, Turan will be...!

00:14:33.206 --> 00:14:36.043
Me, strike down my sister...?

00:14:36.293 --> 00:14:40.213
We have disclosed everything
to you with full resolve.

00:14:40.464 --> 00:14:42.591
Please give us your decision.

00:14:42.841 --> 00:14:45.677
Is now not the time to clear
your sister's disgrace?!

00:14:45.927 --> 00:14:49.723
You can get near Princess Liliana
without raising suspicion.

00:14:49.973 --> 00:14:52.476
I know it's a terrible thing to ask!

00:14:52.726 --> 00:14:56.938
But this is the only choice we have!

00:14:57.189 --> 00:14:58.857
Please give your decision!

00:15:06.740 --> 00:15:08.200
<i>You“).!</i>

00:15:11.161 --> 00:15:13.246
Don't hurt them!

00:15:13.497 --> 00:15:16.416
--You turned us in, Princess?!
--Huh?!

00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:19.961
--You would abandon Turan too?!
--What?!

00:15:20.212 --> 00:15:23.006
The royal family is untrustworthy after all!

00:15:23.256 --> 00:15:25.300
No! I didn't...!

00:15:27.094 --> 00:15:29.721
Lord Luscinia is expecting you.

00:15:32.474 --> 00:15:33.767
Hey!

00:15:34.017 --> 00:15:35.018
Did you find Millia?!

00:15:35.268 --> 00:15:36.603
We're all looking for her!

00:15:36.853 --> 00:15:40.482
Someone saw her and a young maid
get into a Turan military vehicle!

00:15:40.732 --> 00:15:42.192
A Tu ran vehicle?!

00:15:48.323 --> 00:15:50.867
I've brought the Turan princess.

00:15:51.118 --> 00:15:53.745
Welcome to the Ruins of White.

00:15:53.995 --> 00:15:56.706
It was from this mythical site

00:15:56.957 --> 00:15:59.626
that the proud Guild supervised
this world so long ago.

00:15:59.876 --> 00:16:01.086
Where are Emma and the others?

00:16:01.336 --> 00:16:04.172
I'm sure they will be given suitable punishment.

00:16:04.422 --> 00:16:06.550
They haven't done anything!

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:10.095
As a member of the Turan royal family,
I demand their immediate release!

00:16:10.345 --> 00:16:15.559
Are you also one who thinks that
Liliana and I are the root of all evil?

00:16:15.809 --> 00:16:19.229
That everything would be
fine if it weren't for me?

00:16:21.606 --> 00:16:23.316
Come this way.

00:16:29.239 --> 00:16:31.533
Long ago, when this world had withered,

00:16:31.783 --> 00:16:35.370
the Guild proposed an
emigration into the heavens.

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:41.459
The idea was to abandon this world
and allow humanity alone to survive.

00:16:41.710 --> 00:16:44.004
The amount of authority and resources

00:16:44.254 --> 00:16:48.425
given to the Guild to execute
this plan was unimaginable.

00:16:48.675 --> 00:16:51.094
The "Twins" are one such example.

00:16:51.344 --> 00:16:56.641
To protect the Guild, pairs of boys
were forced to endure cruel training

00:16:56.892 --> 00:16:59.728
and molded into perfect killers.

00:17:01.313 --> 00:17:06.443
It is in people's nature to inflict
self-harm with their own sharpened fangs.

00:17:10.322 --> 00:17:11.990
Liliana wishes to see you.

00:17:13.074 --> 00:17:14.659
She does?!

00:17:16.912 --> 00:17:18.622
Millia...

00:17:18.872 --> 00:17:21.750
Don't worry. She'll come back for sure.

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:25.587
Millia's a lot stronger than she looks!

00:17:34.054 --> 00:17:38.934
I'm told crops from around the
world were once preserved here.

00:17:39.184 --> 00:17:42.354
But now look at it...

00:17:42.604 --> 00:17:45.774
Millia. I'm happy you came.

00:17:46.024 --> 00:17:47.651
Sister...

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:52.572
Why did you betray Turan?

00:17:54.658 --> 00:17:57.244
Admit that what you did was wrong!

00:17:57.494 --> 00:17:59.204
Otherwise, I'll...!

00:17:59.454 --> 00:18:03.250
You cared so much for our people! So why?!

00:18:03.500 --> 00:18:07.629
Why did you betray our people,
destroy our land, and brand yourself a witch?!

00:18:07.879 --> 00:18:11.549
What are you trying to gain?!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:15.679
It appears I've caused you anguish.

00:18:15.929 --> 00:18:17.514
Don't sidestep the question!

00:18:17.764 --> 00:18:20.558
Why are you helping Luscinia?!

00:18:25.647 --> 00:18:27.148
Millia.

00:18:27.399 --> 00:18:31.653
If that's what you believe
you must do, then do it.

00:18:34.531 --> 00:18:35.991
Do it!

00:18:45.625 --> 00:18:49.004
Cast aside your personal feelings
and do what must be done.

00:18:49.254 --> 00:18:52.132
That is the duty of royal family members.

00:18:52.382 --> 00:18:53.967
Sister...

00:18:54.217 --> 00:18:57.095
I made the decision to become a witch.

00:18:59.222 --> 00:19:03.768
This world is too small for us.

00:19:04.019 --> 00:19:08.648
If returnees continue to grow in
number to live out comfortable lives,

00:19:08.898 --> 00:19:13.653
not a century will pass before
another age of calamity falls upon us.

00:19:13.903 --> 00:19:15.238
Even so...!

00:19:15.488 --> 00:19:19.200
--This is the only path I can take.
--You can't be serious...!

00:19:20.660 --> 00:19:22.746
Luscinia is a solitary man.

00:19:22.996 --> 00:19:25.415
He needs someone to walk by his side...

00:19:26.624 --> 00:19:28.043
Sister...

00:19:28.293 --> 00:19:31.338
"To rule a land, one must
make personal sacrifices

00:19:31.588 --> 00:19:33.340
to solve unsolvable problems."

00:19:33.590 --> 00:19:35.592
Our father's words.

00:20:04.162 --> 00:20:06.081
--Millia!
--Millia!

00:20:07.123 --> 00:20:09.167
--What a relief!
--Thank goodness!

00:20:09.417 --> 00:20:10.919
What's the matter?

00:20:16.549 --> 00:20:19.552
Your sister has been safely returned.

00:20:19.803 --> 00:20:23.056
Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

00:20:23.306 --> 00:20:25.600
I feel truly sorry.

00:20:30.438 --> 00:20:33.775
I never thought I would hear
you say something like that.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:40.824
However, we've no choice
but to continue forward.

00:20:41.991 --> 00:20:43.034
That's great!

00:20:43.284 --> 00:20:46.204
So, what did Princess Liliana say?!

00:20:46.454 --> 00:20:49.666
I had no idea...

00:20:49.916 --> 00:20:54.337
I had no idea she was carrying
such a heavy burden all by herself...

00:20:57.298 --> 00:20:58.967
Hey, look!

00:21:01.803 --> 00:21:04.097
You can usually only see it further north!

00:21:04.347 --> 00:21:07.809
It's beautiful! It's just like in Glacies!

00:21:08.059 --> 00:21:10.854
It's almost frightening...

00:21:32.417 --> 00:21:34.335
I actually feel kind of nervous!

00:21:38.214 --> 00:21:40.341
I was worried for a while there,

00:21:40.592 --> 00:21:45.096
but now the war is over and
Millia and Liliana have made up.

00:21:45.346 --> 00:21:48.850
Another Grand Race isn't just a dream anymore!

00:21:49.100 --> 00:21:51.227
Who knows, maybe sometime next year--

00:22:05.617 --> 00:22:08.286
Huh? What? What's going on?!

00:22:11.498 --> 00:22:13.249
Why did you protect me?!

00:22:15.084 --> 00:22:20.757
Because there is something... you still must do...

00:22:21.007 --> 00:22:22.759
Liliana!

00:22:23.009 --> 00:22:28.556
Please look... after my sister...

00:22:31.392 --> 00:22:32.519
Not again!

00:22:32.769 --> 00:22:34.354
Sister!

00:22:35.396 --> 00:22:37.023
--Millia!
--Millia!

00:22:40.276 --> 00:22:42.570
Millia!

00:22:42.820 --> 00:22:44.197
--Millia! Say something!
--Millia!

00:22:44.447 --> 00:22:45.782
--Millia!
--Millia! Stay with us!

00:22:46.032 --> 00:22:48.535
Millia! Millia!

00:22:58.545 --> 00:23:00.338
Sister...

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:02.590
<i>So this is why...</i>

00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:06.177
Sister...

00:24:03.276 --> 00:24:06.779
<i>Turan Refugee Government Special
Tea Squad! Prepare to move out!</i>

00:24:07.030 --> 00:24:07.822
<i>Yes, Sir!</i>

00:24:08.072 --> 00:24:09.949
<i>Commence pot and cup heat retention!</i>

00:24:10.199 --> 00:24:11.409
--Yes, Sir!
--Captain!

00:24:11.659 --> 00:24:13.536
<i>The raisin scones will finish
baking in five minutes!</i>

00:24:13.786 --> 00:24:16.956
<i>Excellent. ETA to afternoon tea: 10 minutes.</i>

00:24:17.206 --> 00:24:19.834
<i>At last, the time has come</i>

00:24:20.084 --> 00:24:21.544
<i>for us to unleash all of the
power we have been gathering!</i>

00:24:21.794 --> 00:24:22.629
<i>Yes, Sir!</i>

00:24:22.879 --> 00:24:25.089
<i>Glory to the Turan Tea Squad!</i>

00:24:25.340 --> 00:24:27.342
<i>Yes, Sir!</i>
